Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0000151

---
 .../extension_info_generator.cc               |  7 +++++
 .../bare_bundled_extensions_loader.cc         | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../bare_bundled_extensions_loader.h          | 17 +++++++++++
 .../extensions/external_provider_impl.cc      |  1 +
